"issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nmaster and 4.4.1-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta\n\n### Issue description\n\nThose black lines should only appears when repeat is enabled.\n<img width=\"1193\" height=\"630\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c72790a2-36d3-4ff4-b9b6-06dd1dadb966\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd a `ColorPickerButton` and make the color overbright then zoom in to see those black lines.\n\nOr create a new control node and add this script to it then reload the saved scene from scene menu.\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Control\n\nfunc _draw() -> void:\n\tvar checker: DPITexture = get_theme_icon(&\"bg\", &\"ColorPickerButton\")\n\tvar texture: DPITexture = get_theme_icon(&\"overbright_indicator\", &\"ColorPicker\")\n\tdraw_texture_rect(checker, Rect2(Vector2(0, 0), size), true)\n\tdraw_rect(Rect2(Vector2(0, 0), size), Color(0, 1, 0, 0.5))\n\tdraw_texture(texture, Vector2(0, 0))\n\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.githu